{"unit_id": "tag:0H3U:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），其每个拟紧开子集（quasi-compact open）都仅有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>是弱正规（normal）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个仿射开子集（affine open）<MATH_0003>，环（ring）<MATH_0004>满足引理<REF_0001>的条件（1）和（2）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在一个由仿射开子集（affine open）组成的覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得每个环（ring）<MATH_0006>都满足引理<REF_0002>的条件（1）和（2）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 存在一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，使得每个开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0008>都是弱正规（normal）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n此外，若<MATH_0009>是弱正规（normal），则其每个开子概形（open subscheme）都是弱正规（normal）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开子集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开子集", "context": "有限性假设所量化的开子集"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "假定数目有限的分支"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "所列条件间的逻辑关系"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "条件（1）的对象"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term"