{"unit_id": "tag:0H3U:proof", "translation": "<MATH_0001>为弱正规（normal）的条件是态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>为同构（isomorphism）。由于<MATH_0003>的构造与到开子概形（open subschemes）的基变换（base change）交换（commutes），并且<MATH_0004>的构造与到<MATH_0005>的开子概形（open subschemes）的基变换（base change）交换（commutes）（引理<REF_0001>），本引理即明。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规", "context": "证明所用的弱正规判据"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "弱正规判据中的态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "判据对态射的要求"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "第一处基变换的目标"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "第一项构造所兼容的操作"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "第一项构造和基变换的关系"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "第二处基变换的目标"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "第二项构造所兼容的操作"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "第二项构造和基变换的关系"}], "notes": []}
