{"unit_id": "tag:03GS:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这个版本可以仅用代数方法（algebraic methods）证明。要证明更强的版本（适用于非仿射（affine）态射（morphisms）），还需要发展更多工具。见《概形的上同调（Cohomology of Schemes）》第<REF_0001>节和《态射（Morphisms）续论》第<REF_0002>节。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic methods", "target_term": "代数方法"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形的上同调"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic methods", "target_term": "代数方法", "context": "该版本所用的证明方法"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "用否定形式限定更强版本的适用对象"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "更强版本所涵盖的对象"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形的上同调", "context": "所引章节的章名"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所引续论章节的章名组成部分"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03GT:statement", "translation": "Zariski 主定理（Zariski's Main Theorem）的代数版本<OWNARGEND_0001>设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的一个仿射（affine）态射（morphism）。\n假设<MATH_0002>是有限型（finite type）的。\n设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>中的正规化（normalization）。图示如下：\n<MATH_0006>\n则存在开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0007>，使得\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0008>是同构（isomorphism），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009>是由<MATH_0010>为拟有限（quasi-finite）之处的点（points）组成的集合（set）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Zariski's Main Theorem", "target_term": "Zariski 主定理"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Zariski's Main Theorem", "target_term": "Zariski 主定理", "context": "定理的显式标题"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所论态射的对象"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "定理对态射的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定理的出发对象"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "定理对态射的第二个假设"}, {"source_term": "normalization", "target_term": "正规化", "context": "定理使用的相对正规化"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "定理断言存在的子概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "所得限制态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "用以刻画该开子概形的局部性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "作为该集合成员的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "由满足性质的点组成"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03GT:proof", "translation": "可以立即归约到<MATH_0001>从而<MATH_0002>均为仿射（affine）的情形。不妨记作<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>。\n于是<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>中的整闭包（integral closure），见定义<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>。由《代数（Algebra）》定理<REF_0003>，对于每个<MATH_0009>，若<MATH_0010>在该点为拟有限（quasi-finite），就存在开子集（open）<MATH_0011>，使得<MATH_0012>为同构（isomorphism）。令<MATH_0013>，其中<MATH_0014>遍取<MATH_0015>为拟有限（quasi-finite）之处的所有点（points）。余下只须证明<MATH_0016>在<MATH_0017>的每个点（points）处都为拟有限（quasi-finite）。\n若<MATH_0018>的像（image）为<MATH_0019>，则<MATH_0020>在<MATH_0021>的某个邻域（neighbourhood）内为同构（isomorphism）。因此<MATH_0022>中不存在特化到（specializes）<MATH_0023>的点（point），因为<MATH_0024>在<MATH_0025>中具有这一性质，见引理<REF_0004>。\n由引理<REF_0005>的第（3）项可知，<MATH_0026>在<MATH_0027>处为拟有限（quasi-finite）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "integral closure", "target_term": "整闭包"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "specializes", "target_term": "特化到"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "归约后两个对象的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral closure", "target_term": "整闭包", "context": "仿射情形下的环构造"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用的定理所在章"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "应用代数定理的逐点前提"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "代数定理给出的开子集"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "代数定理给出的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "确定指标遍取范围的性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "指标所遍取的对象"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "剩余论证须逐点验证的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "剩余论证须证明的性质"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "从所给点得到的像"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "同构成立的局部范围"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "邻域内成立的性质"}, {"source_term": "specializes", "target_term": "特化到", "context": "被排除的点之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "不存在的特化来源"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "使用引理所推出的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03GS:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n利用 Zariski 主定理（Zariski's Main Theorem）的代数版本，可以证明一个态射（morphism）为拟有限（quasi-finite）之处的点（points）所成的集合（set）是开（open）的。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Zariski's Main Theorem", "target_term": "Zariski 主定理"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Zariski's Main Theorem", "target_term": "Zariski 主定理", "context": "所应用的定理"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所研究的映射类型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "决定点是否属于集合的性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "所考虑的集合的成员"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "逐点性质所定义的集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "集合的拓扑性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01TI:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的一个态射（morphism）。在<MATH_0002>中，<MATH_0003>为拟有限（quasi-finite）之处的点（points）组成的集合（set）是一个开子集（open）<MATH_0004>。诱导态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>是局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所考虑的态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "用来确定集合的逐点性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "组成集合的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "具有所给逐点性质的点所成的集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "对点集的拓扑结论"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "开子集上诱导的态射"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限", "context": "诱导态射的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01TI:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>处为拟有限（quasi-finite）。取<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>为定义<REF_0001>中的仿射开子集（affine opens）。\n由上面的定理<REF_0002>或《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>，由素理想（primes）<MATH_0005>中满足<MATH_0006>在其处为拟有限（quasi-finite）的那些素理想所成的集合（set），在<MATH_0007>中是开（open）的。由于这些素理想都对应于<MATH_0008>中<MATH_0009>为拟有限（quasi-finite）之处的点（points），第一项断言成立。第二项断言是显然的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "证明起点的逐点假设"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开子集", "context": "定义中用于检验的仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引引理所在章"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想", "context": "仿射谱上所考察的素理想"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "筛选素理想的性质"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "满足性质的素理想组成的集合"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "该集合的拓扑性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "对应的点所满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "与素理想对应的概形上的点"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03GS:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n后面将把下面的引理推广到一般的拟有限（quasi-finite）分离（separated）态射（morphisms），见《态射（Morphisms）续论》引理<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "推广后仍要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "推广适用的态射条件"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "推广所适用的对象"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所引续论的章名组成部分"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03GU:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>均为仿射（affine），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004>为拟有限（quasi-finite）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则存在图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0005>\n其中<MATH_0006>为仿射（affine），<MATH_0007>为有限（finite），而<MATH_0008>是开浸入（open immersion）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所研究的态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "第一项假设的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "第二项假设的性质"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "引理断言存在的图表"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "所得图表中的概形的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "所得图表中一个态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "所得图表中另一个态射的类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03GU:proof", "translation": "这就是用概形（schemes）的语言重新表述《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "重新表述所用的语言"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引引理所在章"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03J2:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的拟有限（quasi-finite）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的一个闭（closed）的无处稠密（nowhere dense）子集（subset）。则<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的一个无处稠密（nowhere dense）子集（subset）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所论态射的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-finite", "target_term": "拟有限", "context": "引理对态射的假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所研究的态射"}, {"source_term": "closed", "target_term": "闭", "context": "输入子集的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密", "context": "输入子集的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集", "context": "作为假设给出的子集"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密", "context": "输出子集的性质"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集", "context": "在目标对象中的子集"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03J2:proof", "translation": "与引理<REF_0001>的证明一样，这立即归约到基底（base）<MATH_0001>为仿射（affine）的情形。\n此时，<MATH_0002>是一些仿射开子集（affine opens）的有限（finite）并（union）（因为<MATH_0003>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的）。由于每个<MATH_0004>都无处稠密（nowhere dense），而无处稠密（nowhere dense）集（sets）的有限（finite）并（union）仍无处稠密（nowhere dense）（见《拓扑（Topology）》引理<REF_0002>），故只须证明像（image）<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>中无处稠密（nowhere dense）。\n这又归约到<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>均为仿射（affine）的情形。此时应用上面的引理<REF_0003>得到图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0009>\n其中<MATH_0010>为仿射（affine），<MATH_0011>为有限（finite），而<MATH_0012>是开浸入（open immersion）。\n令<MATH_0013>。由《拓扑（Topology）》引理<REF_0004>可知，<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>中无处稠密（nowhere dense）。\n由于<MATH_0016>，本引理由有限（finite）情形的相应结果推出，见引理<REF_0005>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开子集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "nowhere dense", "target_term": "无处稠密"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "首次归约